<title>BRAZIL: TENNIS-UNITED STATES LEAD BRAZIL 1-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-UNITED STATES LEAD BRAZIL 1-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>RIBEIRAO PRETO, Brazil 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United States</p>
<p>took a 1-0 lead over Brazil in their Davis Cup world group first</p>
<p>round tie after winning the opening singles on Friuday.</p>
<p>Result: MaliVai Washington beat Gustavo Kuerten 3-6 7-6</p>
<p>(8-6)</p>
<p>7-6 (7-3) 6-3</p>
</text>
